    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds a Criteria Category" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add a Firm Criteria Category</p>
            <p>Verifies that a new firm criteria category can be added with valid details.</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Firm Criteria Categories. 2. Click "Add" and fill in required details. 3. Save the category.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
